      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Semente Espinhosa. Ferroseed se defende disparando espinhos, embora sua pontaria inicialmente seja ruim e só melhore com muita prática. Ele prefere cavernas cobertas de musgo, cujas enzimas ajudam seus espinhos a crescer fortes.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Mineral &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Ferroseed pode evoluir para Ferrothorn no nível 14 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Harden, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Metal Claw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Pin Missile</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Gyro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Mirror Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Ingrain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Self-Destruct</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Iron Head, Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Explosion, Flash Cannon</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Assurance, Attract, Bullet Seed, Confide, Double Team, Endeavor, Energy Ball, Explosion, Facade, Flash Cannon, Frustration, Giga Drain, Gravity, Gyro Ball, Hidden Power, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Knock Off, Magnet Rise, Nature Power, Payback, Pin Missile, Poison Jab, Protect, Rest, Return, Revenge, Rock Polish, Round, Seed Bomb, Self-Destruct, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Stealth Rock, Steel Beam, Steel Roller, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acid Spray, Bullet Seed, Gravity, Knock Off, Leech Seed, Rock Climb, Seed Bomb, Spikes, Stealth Rock, Toxic, Worry Seed</p>",
